Package: geoareaweight
Type: Package
Title: Area Weights and Area-Weighted Means for Latitude-Longitude Grids
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Longhao", "Wang", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "hhuwlh@163.com")
Description: Cosine-latitude, exact spherical band and WGS84 authalic cell-area weights,
    and NaN-aware area-weighted means, regional means, integrals and area fractions
    for regular, irregular and Gaussian latitude-longitude grids.
